# Doc tracker — Confluence

Required env (shared with Jira if both enabled):

- `ATLASSIAN_SITE_URL`
- `ATLASSIAN_USER_EMAIL`
- `ATLASSIAN_API_TOKEN`

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=confluence -->

- Read page → `mcp__atlassian__get_confluence_page` by id or title.
- Create page → `mcp__atlassian__create_confluence_page` under a parent.
- Update page → `mcp__atlassian__update_confluence_page`.

